Thank you for contributing! Create a pull request and I will review it to include in the project.

Run `python3 build.py` after changing questions, tasks, or `template_checklist.html`, and commit the generated `checklist.html` and `checklist.txt` files.

Run the tests before opening a pull request:

```bash
python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v
node --test tests/checklist.test.js
```

Node.js 18 or newer is required for the build and the browser page.
